   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "BF16: the two agree, the cast is a free reinterpretation.\nFP8: exchange 16-bit halves between the 4 lanes (shfl.sync with\nc = 0x1C1F, so lane indices are relative to each 4-lane segment),\nthen byte permute. Without it the kernel multiplies the wrong\nrows of V: max error 11.9 vs 0.05 with it.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "BF16: the two agree, the cast is a free reinterpretation.\nFP8: exchange 16-bit halves between the 4 lanes (shfl.sync with\nc = 0x1C1F, so lane indices are relative to each 4-lane segment),\nthen byte permute. Without it the kernel multiplies the wrong\nrows of V: max error 11.9 vs 0.05 with it.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
