   "versionNonce": 2078054028,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Per-tensor scales: s_q = max|Q| / 448, same for K and V. The kernel multiplies the scores by s_q s_k / sqrt(d) before the softmax and the output by s_v / l at the end.\nP in [0, 1] is cast to e4m3 unscaled (3 mantissa bits: relative step 1/8). Accumulation stays FP32, output stays BF16.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Per-tensor scales: s_q = max|Q| / 448, same for K and V. The kernel multiplies the scores by s_q s_k / sqrt(d) before the softmax and the output by s_v / l at the end.\nP in [0, 1] is cast to e4m3 unscaled (3 mantissa bits: relative step 1/8). Accumulation stays FP32, output stays BF16.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
